Orca 1.4.197

Pinned snapshot of the `orca-cli` and `orchestration` skill stubs shipped
by that Orca release (S9, claude-orca-3sk.20). Both are discovery stubs:
the version-matched usage guide is served by the `orca` binary itself
(`orca skills get <name>`), so a stub that lags the installed app costs a
stale trigger list, never a stale command surface.

Installed into <project>/.claude-dev/home/.claude/skills/ by
scripts/sandbox/claude-orca-shell ONLY while .claude-dev/sandbox.json has
{"orca":{"cli":true}} -- they are deliberately NOT under config/skills/,
which config-sync.sh mirrors unconditionally. Re-pin by re-copying both
SKILL.md files from a newer Orca and bumping the line above.
